---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { tracks, isOpen, firstLive, lessonUrl } from '../data/site';
const first = tracks.find(isOpen)!;
const start = lessonUrl(first, firstLive(first)!);
---
<Base title="learn-genai.in" description="Short lessons on working with AI for senior engineers, tech leads and engineering managers. One clear idea at a time.">
  <main>
    <section class="col hero">
      <p class="kicker">for engineers who build things</p>
      <h1 class="display">Learn to work with AI, <span class="hl">one clear idea</span> at a time.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Short lessons for senior engineers, tech leads and engineering managers. Each lesson explains one idea, shows it in a hand drawing, and ends with something you can try at work.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href={start}>Start reading</a>
        <a class="link" href={`/${first.slug}/`}>See the contents</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap">
      <div class="steps">
        <div><h3>1. Read</h3><p>About five minutes. One idea, written in plain words.</p></div>
        <div><h3>2. Watch it drawn</h3><p>The idea is drawn by hand, step by step, when you scroll to it.</p></div>
        <div><h3>3. Check yourself</h3><p>One short question, so you know the idea has landed.</p></div>
        <div><h3>4. Try it at work</h3><p>One thing to do today in the tools you already use.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="col book">
      <h2 class="hand-h"><span>The book so far</span></h2>
      <p>The site is written like a book, one track after another. A track opens when the notes for it are ready.</p>
      <ol class="rows">
        {tracks.map((t) => (
          <li>
            {isOpen(t) ? (
              <a class="row" href={`/${t.slug}/`}>
                <span class="row-main"><span class="row-title">{t.title}</span><span class="row-blurb">{t.blurb}</span></span>
                <span class="row-tag open">Open, more lessons coming</span>
              </a>
            ) : (
              <div class="row planned">
                <span class="row-main"><span class="row-title">{t.title}</span><span class="row-blurb">{t.blurb}</span></span>
                <span class="row-tag">{t.label ?? 'Coming'}</span>
              </div>
            )}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
